<title>SOUTH KOREA: Seoul confirms N.Korea defector on way to S.Korea.</title>
<headline>Seoul confirms N.Korea defector on way to S.Korea.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Korean defector Hwang Jang-yop is on his way to South Korea from the Philippines, a South Korean official, who declined to be identified, told reporters on Sunday.</p>
<p>Hwang would arrive at around noon local time (0300 GMT), the official said. He gave no further details.</p>
